{"id":"adf7b5cbd73dbafa","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-iterative-construction.md","title":"集合长度的超限单调构造","display":"df-iterative-construction — 集合长度的超限单调构造","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-iterative-construction","aliases":["91-df-iterative-construction","91-df-transfinite-iteration"],"display":"df-iterative-construction — 集合长度的超限单调构造","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-iterative-construction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-iterative-construction</span><span>91-df-transfinite-iteration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-iterative-construction — 集合长度的超限单调构造"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\\)</span> 为单调算子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq J(A)\">\\(A\\subseteq J(A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 为集合序数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec X\">\\(\\vec X\\)</span> 为候选函数，定义域要求为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta+1\">\\(\\theta+1\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iterative\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Iter}_\\theta(J,A,\\vec X)\\coloneqq\n\\vec X:\\theta+1\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\\land X_0=A\\land\n\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\theta\\,[X_{\\alpha+1}=J(X_\\alpha)]\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\le\\theta\\,[\\lambda\\text{ 为非零极限序数}\\to X_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}X_\\beta].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iterative\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Iter}_\\theta(J,A,\\vec X)\\coloneqq\n\\vec X:\\theta+1\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\\land X_0=A\\land\n\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\theta\\,[X_{\\alpha+1}=J(X_\\alpha)]\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\le\\theta\\,[\\lambda\\text{ 为非零极限序数}\\to X_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta&lt;\\lambda}X_\\beta].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>存在唯一性由超限递归；起点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq J(A)\">\\(A\\subseteq J(A)\\)</span> 确保递增。旧版缺少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_0=A\">\\(X_0=A\\)</span> 的绑定，还把可能包含零的极限谓词用于起点，不能完整确定过程。\n有向并是迭代的极限定义，本身不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 连续。对本目录单步算子，阶段编号不应解释成仅仅增加一层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 嵌套。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 15.5、Lemmata 15.6–15.8、Definitions 15.9–15.11、Lemmata 15.12–15.14，印刷页 189–196，PDF 页 200–207；§8.7 的正归纳定义方法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"J:\\mathcal P(C_T)\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq J(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec X","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}iterative\\text{-}construction}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Iter}_\\theta(J,A,\\vec X)\\coloneqq\n\\vec X:\\theta+1\\to\\mathcal P(C_T)\\land X_0=A\\land\n\\forall\\alpha<\\theta\\,[X_{\\alpha+1}=J(X_\\alpha)]\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\le\\theta\\,[\\lambda\\text{ 为非零极限序数}\\to X_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\beta<\\lambda}X_\\beta].","display":true},{"tex":"A\\subseteq J(A)","display":false},{"tex":"X_0=A","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1453,"backlinks":[{"id":"2e7d619feee516bd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-iterative-construction]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-consistency.md]]\n